From: boingbasti <117715317+boingbasti@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] avformat/mpegts: map stream type 0x87 to E-AC3

ATSC A/52 declares Enhanced AC-3 as stream type 0x87 in the PMT. Without
the entry such a stream stays without codec when probing is limited, and
the audio track is missing.

---
 libavformat/mpegts.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/libavformat/mpegts.c b/libavformat/mpegts.c
--- a/libavformat/mpegts.c
+++ b/libavformat/mpegts.c
@@ -855,5 +855,6 @@
 static const StreamType MISC_types[] = {
     { 0x81, AVMEDIA_TYPE_AUDIO, AV_CODEC_ID_AC3 },
+    { 0x87, AVMEDIA_TYPE_AUDIO, AV_CODEC_ID_EAC3 },
     { 0x8a, AVMEDIA_TYPE_AUDIO, AV_CODEC_ID_DTS },
     { 0 },
 };
